<title>UK: NIB sets 2.0 billion Lux franc December 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>NIB sets 2.0 billion Lux franc December 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg books), BIL (books), Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit and Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDIC INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    20.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE  S-20.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 YIELD	 5.18</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 PRAECIP    0.178     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
